  "description": "Highly optimized, high-performance lossless RGB and RGBA image format. On a 5,000-image benchmark, FIC Fast used 53x less aggregate encode time and produced 24.6% smaller files than SkiaSharp PNG. In 512x512 synthetic tests, FIC Fast encoded and decoded faster than PNG, often in 0-2 ms. Results vary by image, settings, and hardware. Supports Deflate, GZip, Zstandard, Brotli, and EXIF metadata.",
